WEBVTT

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:01.759
Welcome to Resgrid Academy.

00:00:02.119 --> 00:00:06.190
In this lesson, we will connect service activity to costs and billing.

00:00:06.659 --> 00:00:10.840
Re-entering activity into estimates, invoices, and cost spreadsheets

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:14.210
creates inconsistent rates and missed supporting evidence.

00:00:14.569 --> 00:00:17.559
We will explain the features, the setup decisions, and a

00:00:17.559 --> 00:00:19.430
practical way to check the result.

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:24.270
An event standby is invoiced from its deployment record, and a mutual-aid

00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:26.430
claim is prepared for MARS reimbursement.

00:00:26.879 --> 00:00:30.339
Bill for standby and contract services and prepare reimbursement

00:00:30.339 --> 00:00:32.329
claims from records you already keep.

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:36.209
